WEBVTT

00:02.419 --> 00:03.586
Fucking bastard.

00:07.382 --> 00:08.216
Who was it?

00:16.641 --> 00:17.475
Hey.

00:20.645 --> 00:22.272
I told you not to fuck around

00:22.814 --> 00:24.733
when you're out working for me.

00:28.445 --> 00:29.863
What the hell are you doing?

00:33.742 --> 00:34.701
I'm sorry.

00:36.953 --> 00:37.787
Hey.

00:39.831 --> 00:40.999
Seok-dae's cousin

00:41.666 --> 00:43.376
was beaten up by someone.

00:44.085 --> 00:45.086
So we went to see him.

00:45.170 --> 00:47.547
So you went to see him and got beaten up?

00:48.631 --> 00:50.300
It wasn't that bad--

00:59.559 --> 01:00.560
Okay.

01:03.646 --> 01:05.148
Payback will be ten times worse.

01:05.648 --> 01:07.108
Right?

01:15.909 --> 01:18.119
Let's make some money, yeah?

01:18.203 --> 01:19.454
I'll help you out.

01:46.773 --> 01:51.903
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 1

02:46.416 --> 02:48.168
Watch how the master does it.

02:51.713 --> 02:52.589
Take away ten.

02:56.050 --> 02:58.136
Didn't we meet for the assignment?

03:02.348 --> 03:03.474
Yeah, you're right.

03:04.350 --> 03:05.185
Mr. Si-eun.

03:05.894 --> 03:07.687
It's the weekend, right?

03:07.770 --> 03:10.398
Sometimes you need to play
to get the blood flowing.

03:10.899 --> 03:12.650
Then your brain will work better.

03:15.445 --> 03:17.071
So you're not going to college?

03:17.155 --> 03:18.531
So close!

03:19.616 --> 03:21.409
Did you get shot in the head?

03:21.492 --> 03:23.203
Why would I want more school?

03:23.912 --> 03:25.288
It's your turn.

03:28.374 --> 03:30.168
Move a bit faster.

03:30.251 --> 03:31.669
Don't just sit there!

03:32.170 --> 03:33.296
Seriously.

03:42.263 --> 03:43.723
Law of reflection.

03:43.806 --> 03:47.769
The angles of incidence
and reflection should be equal.

03:48.269 --> 03:51.397
Angle of incidence, 35 degrees.
Margin of error, three degrees.

03:51.481 --> 03:53.483
Success rate, 90%.

04:04.035 --> 04:05.203
Let's go.

04:10.667 --> 04:12.627
You can't go. It's best of three.

04:13.294 --> 04:15.255
You need to raise your handicap this time.

04:19.467 --> 04:21.302
The result will be the same.

04:21.886 --> 04:22.762
Wow.

04:23.888 --> 04:25.306
Is that so?

04:25.390 --> 04:26.975
You think it'll be the same?

04:27.058 --> 04:29.394
Loser buys everyone Chinese food.

04:29.894 --> 04:32.397
Noodles, pork, stir-fried beef? Your call.

04:42.323 --> 04:43.324
Damn!

04:48.037 --> 04:49.455
You know I went easy on you?

04:50.415 --> 04:51.457
Nope.

04:51.541 --> 04:53.793
I'm so fucking miserable.

04:53.876 --> 04:55.837
Whatever. Let's get some beer.

04:57.005 --> 04:57.880
I have to go.

04:57.964 --> 04:59.007
You two go.

05:00.174 --> 05:02.760
Why? It's on me, so let's all go.

05:02.844 --> 05:04.554
I'm behind my schedule because of you.

05:06.139 --> 05:07.140
Okay, fine.

05:07.223 --> 05:08.266
Take care.

05:09.517 --> 05:10.977
You got lucky today.

05:11.060 --> 05:12.478
Next time, you're toast.

05:15.815 --> 05:17.317
Where do we go to drink?

05:17.400 --> 05:20.069
Don't worry about it. Just follow me.

05:38.921 --> 05:41.007
Hey, what happened to your arm?

05:44.510 --> 05:46.220
What do you think?

05:46.304 --> 05:48.473
He got hurt because of you.

05:51.517 --> 05:52.352
What?

05:54.228 --> 05:55.063
Who are you?

05:56.981 --> 05:58.524
It's not important.

05:59.233 --> 06:01.402
Would you mind doing me a favor?

06:32.975 --> 06:35.603
Fuck, why is that jerk here? I'm screwed.

06:38.564 --> 06:39.816
Can I help you find…

06:41.192 --> 06:42.860
That will be 13,000 won.

06:43.611 --> 06:45.780
Did you pay? I didn't find anything.

06:46.531 --> 06:47.657
Have a nice day.

06:48.491 --> 06:50.618
I'm hungry. Let's go. Thank you!

06:56.666 --> 06:59.001
No way! What's with this rain?

07:00.962 --> 07:02.046
Whoa.

07:02.130 --> 07:03.714
Why is it raining so much?

07:04.465 --> 07:05.299
What? Hey!

07:09.720 --> 07:11.347
I don't have an umbrella.

07:16.060 --> 07:17.061
Walk me home.

07:17.728 --> 07:18.604
Why should I?

07:18.688 --> 07:20.940
Because you have an umbrella, and I don't.

07:21.023 --> 07:22.650
- Do you like tteokbokki?
- No.

07:22.733 --> 07:26.195
Well, you can like it from now on.
I know a good place around here.

07:29.449 --> 07:30.533
It's really spicy!

07:33.286 --> 07:34.120
Hey.

07:35.788 --> 07:37.248
Can I go now?

07:37.331 --> 07:38.541
Absolutely not.

07:40.042 --> 07:42.253
- Why?
- I don't like eating by myself.

07:44.630 --> 07:46.591
Why aren't you eating? Too spicy?

07:47.633 --> 07:48.593
Why do you eat it?

07:49.927 --> 07:51.137
I bet you have no friends.

07:58.060 --> 07:59.145
Save my number.

07:59.896 --> 08:01.022
What's your name?

08:02.773 --> 08:03.774
Why?

08:06.277 --> 08:07.737
ASSHOLE

08:07.820 --> 08:09.030
You're fucking rude,

08:09.113 --> 08:10.781
which is totally my type.

08:11.949 --> 08:13.910
I like guys who are assholes.

08:16.746 --> 08:18.206
Thanks!

08:23.753 --> 08:25.004
See you next time.

08:25.671 --> 08:26.756
Sorry about the other day.

08:29.050 --> 08:30.510
I'm on my way.

08:30.593 --> 08:32.178
Got it. I'll hurry.

08:33.346 --> 08:34.180
Yeah.

08:44.857 --> 08:46.025
Where's Yeong-i?

08:46.108 --> 08:47.235
She's on her way.

08:51.739 --> 08:54.116
- Is Gil-su inside?
- Yeah.

08:56.035 --> 08:57.203
Good job, man.

08:57.286 --> 09:00.248
Some crazy bastard brought his mom's car.

09:01.082 --> 09:03.334
- Fucking lunatic.
- So fucking stupid.

09:05.169 --> 09:06.420
Fucking bastard.

09:07.421 --> 09:09.465
I told you to pick up when I call.

09:10.800 --> 09:11.842
I'm sorry.

09:11.926 --> 09:12.802
Are you?

09:15.012 --> 09:16.639
How do you plan to pay me back?

09:19.559 --> 09:21.227
I'll talk to my mom.

09:24.146 --> 09:25.565
You have three days.

09:26.065 --> 09:27.984
If I don't get my money by then,

09:28.818 --> 09:31.904
I'll fucking kill your mommy and daddy,

09:31.988 --> 09:34.657
and I'll burn your fucking house down.

09:44.417 --> 09:45.334
Is it okay?

09:45.918 --> 09:46.877
Yes.

09:48.713 --> 09:49.880
Good job!

09:51.465 --> 09:53.301
Oh, that fucker.

09:53.384 --> 09:57.096
Beat that fucker for half an hour
before letting him go.

09:58.180 --> 09:59.724
Just stab him if you want.

10:22.455 --> 10:23.664
Oh, what?

10:24.290 --> 10:26.584
I'm first. Hey!

10:26.667 --> 10:28.127
I'm taking it now. Here.

10:28.836 --> 10:29.670
Su-ho, a car.

10:29.754 --> 10:31.589
Oh yeah. Get in the car here!

10:32.089 --> 10:33.257
Is that all you got?

10:33.341 --> 10:35.384
Yeah, I'll take that.

10:35.468 --> 10:37.345
- I'll take that.
- No, that's mine.

10:37.845 --> 10:38.679
Yeon Si-eun.

10:44.226 --> 10:45.853
Can we talk for a second?

10:47.897 --> 10:49.315
There's nothing to talk about.

10:49.815 --> 10:51.734
Hey, what's your problem this time?

10:56.739 --> 10:57.865
It won't take long.

11:04.497 --> 11:05.581
Please help me.

11:07.750 --> 11:09.251
Just meet with my lawyer.

11:11.295 --> 11:12.296
The fentanyl.

11:12.880 --> 11:14.507
Tell them it wasn't mine.

11:17.426 --> 11:18.552
You too, Beom-seok.

11:21.639 --> 11:23.349
It's driving me crazy.

11:23.432 --> 11:25.142
I mean the world to my mom.

11:28.771 --> 11:29.605
Please help.

11:30.189 --> 11:32.441
I could go to juvenile detention!

11:34.652 --> 11:36.487
His fake tears are pathetic.

11:38.781 --> 11:39.615
Si-eun.

11:40.950 --> 11:42.868
Should we just give a statement?

11:43.494 --> 11:45.162
It's no big deal.

12:17.987 --> 12:18.821
Hey.

12:19.572 --> 12:20.906
Why are we going down?

12:20.990 --> 12:22.658
Oh, this way is faster.

12:24.618 --> 12:26.078
If you lie, you're dead.

12:26.871 --> 12:27.872
I'm not lying.

12:31.000 --> 12:32.126
Hurry up.

12:32.710 --> 12:34.587
What do you want to eat later?

12:34.670 --> 12:36.046
I have to go study.

12:36.130 --> 12:39.300
Damn! On your own?

12:39.383 --> 12:41.594
Let's have black bean noodles later.

12:41.677 --> 12:43.304
Or go to an Internet café.

12:43.387 --> 12:44.972
Don't you have to work tonight?

12:45.055 --> 12:46.474
Do I have a shift today?

12:52.980 --> 12:54.315
I don't think I'll make it.

13:01.781 --> 13:02.656
I called it.

13:04.658 --> 13:07.119
Gentlemen, nice to meet you.

13:25.721 --> 13:27.723
Seok-dae, is this them?

13:29.225 --> 13:30.059
Yes.

13:34.855 --> 13:36.273
Now, as you know,

13:36.774 --> 13:38.025
because of you gentlemen,

13:38.567 --> 13:40.277
Seok-dae was badly hurt.

13:41.570 --> 13:44.448
I mean, he's a poor kid with no insurance,

13:44.990 --> 13:46.617
yet you beat him up.

13:47.243 --> 13:48.244
What do you want?

13:50.412 --> 13:51.497
You have three days.

13:53.374 --> 13:55.292
Bring me 15 million won to settle this.

13:57.920 --> 13:59.463
What's this bullshit?

13:59.964 --> 14:01.090
What's that cast?

14:01.882 --> 14:03.425
I never touched your arm.

14:03.509 --> 14:07.221
You smashed his wrist just like this,

14:07.304 --> 14:08.430
yet you forgot that.

14:08.514 --> 14:09.390
But…

14:10.975 --> 14:12.476
do you have any proof?

14:18.107 --> 14:21.235
These guys are fucking ridiculous!

14:21.735 --> 14:22.570
Hey.

14:25.030 --> 14:26.949
I kill people for money.

14:28.367 --> 14:30.160
I maim people too.

14:30.244 --> 14:32.746
You're proud of that at your age?

14:32.830 --> 14:33.998
You fucker.

14:39.295 --> 14:40.754
Is this a joke to you?

14:44.341 --> 14:45.551
You have three days.

14:47.344 --> 14:49.054
If you can't get the money by then,

14:50.055 --> 14:52.016
you'll need to borrow it from me.

14:56.020 --> 14:57.646
Rude bastard.

15:00.608 --> 15:01.609
Hey, let's go.

15:24.214 --> 15:25.424
Su-ho, are you okay?

15:27.676 --> 15:29.553
- I'm not okay, fuck.
- One sec.

15:32.556 --> 15:33.641
What do we do?

15:34.808 --> 15:36.018
They don't scare me.

15:50.282 --> 15:51.200
Here they come.

16:06.590 --> 16:08.342
If you go, I'll go too.

16:08.425 --> 16:09.927
I'll go over it again at home.

16:17.184 --> 16:18.018
Is that them?

17:09.653 --> 17:10.487
Hello?

17:11.238 --> 17:12.448
Let's meet up.

17:38.223 --> 17:39.308
That guy.

17:39.391 --> 17:40.601
Who is he?

17:41.101 --> 17:41.935
Who?

17:44.938 --> 17:45.773
Oh.

17:47.024 --> 17:48.192
Gil-su?

17:51.028 --> 17:54.448
He just gives us work and a place to stay.

17:55.032 --> 17:57.201
- What work?
- Just this and that.

17:58.535 --> 17:59.912
Why do you want to know?

18:06.251 --> 18:07.795
I shouldn't say this, but…

18:11.298 --> 18:13.675
be careful with him. He's a total scumbag.

18:15.344 --> 18:18.013
He wasn't lying about killing for money.

18:19.556 --> 18:22.059
He's got connections to real gangsters.

18:23.977 --> 18:26.522
He's not human. He's money-hungry trash.

18:27.689 --> 18:28.524
So?

18:28.607 --> 18:31.276
So give him the money.
Even if it's just half.

18:32.027 --> 18:32.945
And if I don't?

18:34.530 --> 18:35.906
Then what?

18:42.538 --> 18:43.455
You're fucked.

18:46.333 --> 18:48.127
You'll be fucked like us.

18:57.761 --> 18:58.595
And if I do?

19:00.180 --> 19:01.014
What?

19:04.059 --> 19:05.102
Will it be over?

19:11.733 --> 19:12.734
Are you okay?

20:16.673 --> 20:17.716
Hey.

20:17.799 --> 20:18.634
What is it?

20:19.509 --> 20:20.344
What?

20:22.221 --> 20:24.306
I'm hungry.

20:27.142 --> 20:29.519
CHEMISTRY LAB

20:35.317 --> 20:37.653
I'll take care of it today.

20:40.322 --> 20:41.573
It's been three days.

20:47.037 --> 20:48.080
Fifteen million won.

20:50.582 --> 20:52.376
Let's pay him and end this.

20:54.711 --> 20:55.712
What is this?

20:57.130 --> 20:59.049
My parents gave it to me.

20:59.132 --> 21:00.884
Are you kidding me?

21:01.510 --> 21:03.762
Your parents gave you 15 million won?

21:04.388 --> 21:05.389
Where's it from?

21:06.598 --> 21:08.600
Does it matter?

21:08.684 --> 21:09.685
Where is it from?

21:11.520 --> 21:12.437
What is this?

21:16.233 --> 21:17.442
I sold my dad's watch.

21:17.943 --> 21:20.654
He was going to pass it down to me anyway.

21:20.737 --> 21:22.572
This dude is nuts.

21:23.991 --> 21:25.158
Why give him the money?

21:25.242 --> 21:26.743
Just report him to the police.

21:28.829 --> 21:31.415
Take it and get the watch back.

21:32.749 --> 21:35.335
He said the police can't help us.

21:36.378 --> 21:37.212
Beom-seok.

21:38.964 --> 21:39.965
Thank you.

21:41.300 --> 21:43.719
I know what to do,
so don't worry about it.

21:43.802 --> 21:45.429
What do you mean?

21:46.305 --> 21:47.681
Just report it to the police.

21:47.764 --> 21:49.891
Yeah, I will.

21:57.941 --> 22:00.819
That bastard gets runaway kids
to work for him.

22:01.987 --> 22:03.405
PROMISSORY NOTE

22:03.488 --> 22:06.199
You know Free Money? It's all the rage.

22:07.951 --> 22:09.161
What's that?

22:09.244 --> 22:10.537
A gambling site.

22:11.121 --> 22:14.333
New members get 50,000 won.
That's why it's called "Free Money."

22:15.917 --> 22:18.211
It's run by Gil-su's overseas partners.

22:18.920 --> 22:20.047
It's all rigged.

22:20.756 --> 22:22.466
The first few rounds, you always win.

22:22.549 --> 22:24.634
You'll earn tens of millions of won

22:24.718 --> 22:26.970
because you win constantly.

22:28.388 --> 22:32.100
But at some point, you lose everything.

22:33.810 --> 22:35.020
It's totally rigged.

22:35.896 --> 22:37.606
A moment ago, you had millions.

22:38.190 --> 22:39.524
If it goes back to zero,

22:39.608 --> 22:40.942
you'll lose your mind.

22:42.736 --> 22:45.113
So you keep gambling to get it back.

22:45.989 --> 22:49.785
How can they continue
if they lost all their money?

22:53.455 --> 22:55.707
Because Gil-su has their information.

22:55.791 --> 22:58.126
He offers them a private loan.

23:01.129 --> 23:06.051
Since they're kids and can't pay him back,
they give him collateral.

23:06.843 --> 23:09.429
A few days ago,
one kid even used his mom's car.

23:11.306 --> 23:14.142
He uses that to extort money from parents.

23:16.186 --> 23:19.648
He uses the runaway kids' bank accounts
for illegal loan transactions.

23:20.357 --> 23:21.858
He makes them deal drugs.

23:22.651 --> 23:24.569
That's how he gets them involved in crime,

23:24.653 --> 23:25.904
so they can't escape.

23:27.572 --> 23:30.742
I heard he has the ledger, contracts,
and drugs at their place.

23:30.826 --> 23:33.120
We need to take the police there.

23:36.039 --> 23:37.666
How do you know all of this?

23:39.418 --> 23:40.335
Googling?

23:43.922 --> 23:46.508
No, not really.

23:50.053 --> 23:51.763
Now that Si-eun has a good plan,

23:52.347 --> 23:54.474
should we eat before we make our move?

23:54.558 --> 23:56.768
I'm so hungry I could die. Seriously.

24:05.652 --> 24:06.611
Hey, wait.

24:10.740 --> 24:11.575
What is it?

24:15.787 --> 24:18.123
Let me go there before you guys.

24:19.374 --> 24:20.208
What?

24:22.252 --> 24:26.882
If he really has the ledger and drugs
in his office or whatever,

24:26.965 --> 24:28.675
we should get the cops there.

24:29.301 --> 24:31.428
Yeah, I'll call them now.

24:31.511 --> 24:35.140
Not yet. The cops need to catch him there.
Photos won't help.

24:36.641 --> 24:39.811
I'll go first and send you the address.

24:39.895 --> 24:41.229
Drag the cops there.

24:42.022 --> 24:43.273
I'll buy us some time.

24:43.356 --> 24:45.358
You can't go there by yourself.

24:46.693 --> 24:49.112
Don't you realize
I'm the boss at this school?

24:49.196 --> 24:50.155
Don't you trust me?

24:51.448 --> 24:52.699
It's fine!

24:53.366 --> 24:54.242
I'm going.

25:04.961 --> 25:05.921
Hey!

25:07.047 --> 25:08.757
Did the three musketeers break up?

25:10.926 --> 25:13.595
Do you need a whole gang to pick up money?

25:13.678 --> 25:14.721
Pathetic assholes.

25:15.472 --> 25:16.890
Stop talking shit.

25:17.432 --> 25:18.266
Hand it over.

25:19.351 --> 25:20.352
Before all that,

25:21.728 --> 25:23.188
let's talk for a moment.

25:23.271 --> 25:24.689
Shit.

25:26.775 --> 25:28.026
No money, then?

25:28.818 --> 25:29.986
Hey.

25:30.987 --> 25:32.906
Don't worry about the money.

25:34.491 --> 25:35.700
That's not it.

25:36.576 --> 25:37.410
Gil-su.

25:38.370 --> 25:39.829
I'm the boss at this school.

25:41.790 --> 25:43.458
About your gambling site…

25:43.959 --> 25:46.920
With some tweaks, you'd make more money.

25:47.003 --> 25:48.380
Wait.

25:50.966 --> 25:52.342
How do you know about that?

25:55.804 --> 25:56.638
Him.

25:57.639 --> 25:59.432
His cousin is in my class.

25:59.933 --> 26:02.352
He showed me the site once.

26:07.148 --> 26:09.776
You give new users
50,000 won to play with.

26:10.986 --> 26:14.990
But don't do that only once at the start.
Give it out three times max.

26:16.199 --> 26:18.118
You could offer a referral reward too.

26:19.703 --> 26:22.372
That could easily turn the school
into a gambling den.

26:24.124 --> 26:25.542
You must have an office.

26:25.625 --> 26:27.627
Let's have coffee at your place.

26:28.378 --> 26:29.212
Yeah?

26:39.514 --> 26:41.558
This guy has some ambition!

26:42.851 --> 26:44.269
Okay. Get in.

26:44.352 --> 26:45.562
Hey, you drive.

26:46.062 --> 26:47.647
- Yes, sir.
- Sir?

26:50.233 --> 26:52.402
Why don't we wait for the other two?

26:52.485 --> 26:53.695
Just in case.

26:57.115 --> 26:58.033
Sure. Go ahead.

26:59.409 --> 27:00.285
Seong-chan, get in.

27:00.952 --> 27:02.287
The newbie is with me.

27:34.027 --> 27:34.986
What are you doing?

27:41.242 --> 27:42.077
Wait a minute.

27:44.245 --> 27:46.414
- Are they going to the office?
- Yeah.

27:47.082 --> 27:49.125
Is he going alone? What about the cops?

27:49.209 --> 27:51.711
We'll catch him there. What's the address?

27:52.295 --> 27:54.422
17-1 Sanggye-ro, Nowon-gu, Seoul.

27:55.006 --> 27:56.591
A house with a blue door.

27:57.133 --> 27:59.260
17-1 SANGGYE, NOWON, SEOUL
HOUSE WITH BLUE DOOR

28:07.060 --> 28:09.187
Over here. Taxi!

28:18.154 --> 28:20.657
SI-EUN: IF THE ADDRESS IS RIGHT,
TEXT ANYTHING BACK

28:25.036 --> 28:26.955
What are you doing?

28:28.415 --> 28:30.792
If I'd given him that money,
it'd be over now.

28:30.875 --> 28:32.752
Why did you let Su-ho go by himself?

28:32.836 --> 28:33.962
You saw those guys.

28:34.838 --> 28:36.798
What if something bad happens to Su-ho?

28:39.676 --> 28:41.636
17-1 Sanggye-ro in Nowon, please.

28:55.692 --> 28:56.526
Yeong-i.

28:57.527 --> 28:58.653
What are you doing?

29:05.201 --> 29:07.078
Trying to send Gil-su to jail. Why?

29:07.162 --> 29:08.204
What?

29:09.998 --> 29:11.708
He's gonna get the cops.

29:17.297 --> 29:19.132
We can't keep living like this.

29:20.341 --> 29:22.469
We'll really fuck up our lives.

29:24.387 --> 29:26.055
You're not happy either, are you?

29:40.028 --> 29:42.197
Wait here, okay?

29:42.280 --> 29:43.114
Sure.

30:03.676 --> 30:06.221
What a lovely house.

30:07.013 --> 30:08.014
A blue door.

30:09.724 --> 30:11.142
Is it cobalt blue?

30:13.436 --> 30:14.521
Very pretty.

30:20.902 --> 30:21.820
Let's go.

30:46.719 --> 30:47.929
Have a seat.

30:50.473 --> 30:52.267
This house is nice.

30:52.350 --> 30:53.476
Very vintage.

30:54.143 --> 30:55.228
Anything to drink?

30:55.895 --> 30:58.231
Some water would be great. Thank you.

30:59.232 --> 31:00.066
Water?

31:03.611 --> 31:05.363
Give me your phone.

31:10.326 --> 31:11.452
Why?

31:12.078 --> 31:13.538
For a safe transaction!

31:13.621 --> 31:15.498
This here…

31:15.582 --> 31:17.917
I need to see
if you're cooking something up.

31:18.001 --> 31:22.797
Oh, but you see, I'm someone who takes
personal information very seriously.

31:25.216 --> 31:26.551
We can't work like this.

31:29.929 --> 31:31.014
Is that so?

31:33.433 --> 31:35.894
Then I don't think this is gonna work out.

31:38.479 --> 31:39.397
Give it here.

31:40.857 --> 31:44.485
Don't you trick me, son of a bitch!

31:45.570 --> 31:48.698
You fucking punk! You piece of shit!

31:51.659 --> 31:52.744
Give me his phone.

31:59.459 --> 32:01.544
SI-EUN: COMING WITH THE POLICE NOW

32:01.628 --> 32:03.421
"Coming with the police"?

32:05.173 --> 32:08.009
What a lovely house. A blue door.

32:10.345 --> 32:11.638
Hey!

32:12.472 --> 32:13.306
What's this?

32:15.099 --> 32:16.517
I expected some backup,

32:16.601 --> 32:18.853
but you called the fuzz, you fucker?

32:20.939 --> 32:22.065
Hey!

32:22.148 --> 32:23.775
Call that fucker Seok-dae.

32:25.693 --> 32:26.611
Everyone, follow me.

33:15.660 --> 33:17.704
Hey, did you come alone?

33:18.955 --> 33:21.249
Yeah. The money…

33:24.127 --> 33:25.837
I want to pay you.

33:27.088 --> 33:29.090
Let my friend go, and it's yours.

33:29.173 --> 33:31.384
Damn it! Are you fucking kidding?

33:31.467 --> 33:32.635
Come here.

33:45.940 --> 33:48.109
But this isn't in our jurisdiction.

33:56.826 --> 33:57.910
Anyone here?

34:01.873 --> 34:03.041
Is anyone home?

34:04.584 --> 34:06.961
Hey, kid. Is this the place?

34:07.545 --> 34:08.379
Yes?

34:17.055 --> 34:18.890
This is a bit tricky.

34:21.225 --> 34:24.353
We'll head back now.
Please come to the station later.

34:25.605 --> 34:26.439
What?

34:27.023 --> 34:29.734
We don't have a warrant.

34:30.318 --> 34:32.862
There's nothing we can do
with just a few photos.

34:33.362 --> 34:36.199
I'll pass them on to Violent Crimes.

34:36.699 --> 34:38.659
Come and make a statement later.

34:39.869 --> 34:41.037
Pick up if we call.

36:29.896 --> 36:31.606
AHN SU-HO

36:43.701 --> 36:46.287
There's a room for stashing stolen goods.

36:55.213 --> 36:57.548
The ledger and drugs would be in a safe.

37:03.179 --> 37:06.849
The number you have called
cannot be reached.

37:07.350 --> 37:08.768
We are connecting you…

39:51.931 --> 39:53.724
ALL NAMES, PLACES, AND EVENTS SHOWN
ARE FICTIONAL

39:53.808 --> 39:55.226
ANY SIMILARITY TO REALITY IS COINCIDENTAL

39:55.726 --> 39:59.063
Subtitle translation by: James Webb
